  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Core calculations",
      "items": [
        "Delta = buy volume - sell volume; CumDelta adds each candle's delta",
        "Imbalance level: ask/bid >= 3 (or one side empty) at a price",
        "POC = max-volume price; value area grows from POC to 68% of volume",
        "LVN = local volume minimum below max(mean - 1.5 sd, 0.2 mean)",
        "Composite = 0.30 absorption (0.25 divergence, 0.20 initiative/sweep) + 0.25 level strength + 0.20 bias confidence if aligned"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Detector thresholds (defaults)",
      "items": [
        "Absorption: |delta| >= 50 against the candle colour; or level volume >= 50 within 2 ticks, 2+ attempts",
        "Initiative: |delta| >= 30, volume >= 1.5x rolling average, body >= 3 ticks, delta agrees with colour",
        "Exhaustion: 3 bars, volume down 30%, volume or delta slope negative",
        "Divergence: 10-bar lookback, latest CumDelta peak < 80% of the previous",
        "Sweep: >= 3 book levels in 2 s with low volume per level, strength >= 30"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Trade state machine",
      "items": [
        "No trade: only ABSORPTION near a qualified level (0.2%), same side, score >= 40 opens a trade",
        "WATCHING a level: absorption can enter; a sweep only raises alert_only",
        "Open: same-side initiative moves stop to break even, later ones trail it to the last candle's low/high",
        "Opposite exhaustion or divergence: warning, or exit when strength >= 70",
        "SL/TP from the profile: long SL under VAL, TP at VAH; short mirrored"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Found while tracing",
      "items": [
        "OrderflowSystem._on_candle_close_handler has no caller, so live candles are never saved and no candle/delta broadcast is sent",
        "The hourly volume-profile rebuild reads candles from the database and skips when it finds fewer than 10",
        "Telegram already formats break-even, trail and exit alerts",
        "Divergence assumes a 0.1 tick size (hard-coded)",
        "Runtime feeds are Bybit and MT5; Binance and information-driven bars are not wired in yet"
      ]
    }
  ]
